WHY THIS LESSON MATTERS

================================================================================

Understanding JSX transformation helps you understand what happens behind the scenes when React code is built.

Key points:

Browsers do not execute JSX syntax directly.
JSX must be transformed into JavaScript.
Babel is one tool that can perform this transformation.
Babel can also transform newer JavaScript syntax depending on configuration.
Understanding the process helps with debugging compilation issues.
It improves your understanding of React elements and the build process.

Easy flow:

