BABEL COMPILATION PIPELINE

================================================================================

SOURCE CODE
(JSX + JavaScript)
       ↓
BABEL PARSER
       ↓
ABSTRACT SYNTAX TREE
       ↓
PLUGINS / PRESETS
       ↓
TRANSFORMED AST
       ↓
CODE GENERATOR
